{"sourceUrl":"https://sss.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/item/23441.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:49.221138+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sss.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/item/23441.html","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  为进一步提升招生宣传成效，提高研究生生源质量，</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>北京交通大学系统科学学院将举办</span></span></span><span><span><span>面向2026年研究生招生线上暑期夏令营活动。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>一、活动面向对象</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  拟通过“推荐免试”或“全国统考”的方式攻读我院2026年全日制非定向硕士研究生的2026届全国优秀应届本科毕业生（目前本科三年级）。</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>本科专业应为相关理学专业（系统科学与工程、数学、统计、物理等</span></span></span><span><span><span>）；</span></span></span><span><span><span>或</span></span></span><span><span><span>交通运输类本科专业，例如交通运输、交通工程、物流工程等；或计算机、自动化、通信工程等工学专业。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>二、研究生阶段招收专业</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  研究生阶段招收专为系统科学，实际招收专业名称以2026年招生目录为准。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>三、</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong><span><span><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>时间</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>内容</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>方式</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>注意事项</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>6